                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "John is an Air Force Veteran from #LongBeach who served in the Vietnam War. He shouldn\u2019t have to worry about his and Wilma\u2019s Social Security being cut, or that his veteran friends may not have a place to sleep for the night or that there isn\u2019t enough food to go around.\u00a0\u00a0\n\nDuring @HouseDemocrats\u2019 Cost of Living Week of Action, I am sharing the stories of my constituents. Republicans need to know how the #TrumpTax & Republican cuts take money and services away from the people who risked their lives for our country.",
